},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "46b8c533",
"en_raw": "was open..."
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "c54a3d7d",
"en_raw": "I wanted to borrow the toilet..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "779cd054",
"en_raw": "Sure, use it as you like..."
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "fbaeadc4",
"en_raw": "Sorry, excuse me"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "3e82c27e",
"en_raw": "But... it appears"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "0a825c63",
"en_raw": "Um... it appears...?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "6c4d5c64",
"en_raw": "Listen, you can hear it, right?"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "3479fa1b",
"en_raw": "That woman's voice"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "2dd58ab4",
"en_raw": "A woman's voice...?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "4f9e2640",
"en_raw": "Listen / Don't  ......"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "e07fdc64",
"en_raw": "...It's the ventilation fan"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "b558cad7",
"en_raw": "That's not it"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "564e7c35",
"en_raw": "That's a woman's voice"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "89dea10f",
"en_raw": "who came out resenting me"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "76f554ae",
"en_raw": "Listen again carefully"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "d8f3d529",
"en_raw": "It sounds just like her crying"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "eaf42266",
"en_raw": "I don't hear such a sound"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "2f1063e8",
"en_raw": "That's how it sounds"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "e6488620",
"en_raw": "Come on, listen carefully..."
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "3ddcbb17",
"en_raw": "Listen / Don't  ...She said she'd die"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "a593d664",
"en_raw": "I thought it was her usual hysterics"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "67e51fe5",
"en_raw": "I was fed up"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "983d422c",
"en_raw": "I told her to go ahead and die"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "c1ee7496",
"en_raw": "left her and walked out of the hall"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "ce05de2c",
"en_raw": "...Then the next morning I came"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "5a54e230",
"en_raw": "and she was dangling from the ceiling"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "969c9179",
"en_raw": "That woman, honestly"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "053cf03b",
"en_raw": "dirtying my shop"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "d773575a",
"en_raw": "I don't hear anything like that..."
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "81a6bab0",
"en_raw": "Excuse me"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "233ed1fd",
"en_raw": "Don't get caught by that woman"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "cc1c8281",
